.TH FLATTOPS 1
.SH NAME
flattops \- carrier task-force game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/flattops
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I FlatTops
is a carrier task-force game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 sets squadron heading; button 2 launches fighters (double-tap recalls). Destroy the enemy force. Plus and minus change game speed.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Set friendly squadron heading toward point
.TP
.B RMB
Launch squadron toward point
.TP
.B RMB double-tap
Return squadron
.TP
.B + / =
Increase game speed
.TP
.B - / _
Decrease game speed
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/flattops.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
